      {
        "title": "Issue A: Timer Not Cleared in useExpoStream",
        "content": "**File**: `src/hooks/use-expo-stream.ts:105-115`\n\n**Problem**: Timer might not be cleared if component unmounts or dependencies change\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Current: Potential memory leak\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (!chefStatus) return;\n  if (!chefStatus.active) {\n    stickyTextRef.current = null;\n    setExpo({ text: chefStatus.text, thoughts: [], active: false });\n    const timer = setTimeout(() => {\n      setExpo((prev) =>\n        prev.active ? prev : { text: null, thoughts: [], active: false },\n      );\n    }, 3000);\n    return () => clearTimeout(timer); // Cleared, but...\n  }\n}, [chefStatus]); // ...if chefStatus changes rapidly, old timers leak\n```\n\n**Solution**: Use ref to track and always clear previous timer\n```typescript\nexport function useExpoStream(\n  snapshot: A0Snapshot | null,\n  chefStatus: ChefStatus | null,\n): ExpoState {\n  const [expo, setExpo] = useState<ExpoState>({\n    text: null,\n    thoughts: [],\n    active: false,\n  });\n  const jokeRef = useRef(getRandomJoke());\n  const stickyTextRef = useRef<string | null>(null);\n  const fadeTimerRef = useRef<NodeJS.Timeout | null>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!chefStatus) return;\n\n    if (!chefStatus.active) {\n      stickyTextRef.current = null;\n      setExpo({ text: chefStatus.text, thoughts: [], active: false });\n      \n      // Clear any existing timer\n      if (fadeTimerRef.current) {\n        clearTimeout(fadeTimerRef.current);\n      }\n      \n      fadeTimerRef.current = setTimeout(() => {\n        setExpo((prev) =>\n          prev.active ? prev : { text: null, thoughts: [], active: false },\n        );\n        fadeTimerRef.current = null;\n      }, 3000);\n    }\n    \n    // Cleanup on unmount or dependency change\n    return () => {\n      if (fadeTimerRef.current) {\n        clearTimeout(fadeTimerRef.current);\n        fadeTimerRef.current = null;\n      }\n    };\n  }, [chefStatus]);\n  \n  // ... rest\n}\n```\n\n",
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "title": "Issue B: Cookie Cleanup Missing",
        "content": "**File**: `src/lib/csrf.ts:23`\n\n**Problem**: CSRF cookie set but never removed when token cleared\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Current: Cookie persists after token cleared\nexport function clearCsrfToken() {\n  csrfToken = null;\n  runtimeId = null;\n  // Cookie still exists!\n}\n```\n\n**Solution**: Clear cookie when clearing token\n```typescript\nexport function clearCsrfToken() {\n  if (runtimeId) {\n    // Clear the cookie by setting it to expire in the past\n    document.cookie = `csrf_token_${runtimeId}=; expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 UTC; SameSite=Strict; Path=/`;\n  }\n  csrfToken = null;\n  runtimeId = null;\n  csrfPromise = null;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n",
